Crawl has done exactly this; each god may bring different benefits.

Adapting this to Nethack wouldn't be the world's worst option, but some
care would have to be taken with regard to how changing alignments 
would affect this currently -- and, of course, the hat of backwards (helm of
opposite alignment), especially for Neutrals.

Also, there are some circumstances whose only solution is via prayer;
while normally the player must make a mistake to get into these
circumstances in the first place, that does convert them from "burn your 
prayer" to "instakill".  Care must be taken there as well to make sure
that either alternate solutions are created, or praying must end up
fixing the problems anyway.

